    "reason": "The chart renders show the serverstransporttcps.traefik.io CRD, served at v1alpha1, in both the source release (2.11.2) [ev-dad4d5933f0f] and the target release (3.0.0) [ev-afb8a4f8abec], unchanged. The v2.11.2 docs also already contain traefik.io_serverstransporttcps.yaml [ev-501210bb2f62]. So on this edge the CRD is not newly added, and there is nothing for an environment to be exposed to. Separately, the proposed exposure condition relies on a `--helm-apply-crds` CLI flag that no evidence mentions, and gvk-in-use of a kind that is supposedly new cannot identify an environment affected by the upgrade.",
